{"id":"H2093","lemma":"זָ֑הַם","transliteration":"zaham","sayIt":"ZA-ham","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Zaham","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 2Ch.11.19;\nson of: Rehoboam (H7346) and Mahalath (H4258H);\nbrother of: Jeush (H3266K) and Shemariah (H8114H);\nhalf-brother of: Abijah (H0029I), Attai (H6262I), Ziza (H2124H) and Shelomith (H8019G)\n§ Zaham = \"loathing\"\nthe son of Rehoboam by Mahalath, David's granddaughter","glosses":["zaham"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"2ch-11","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Zaham","kjv":"and Zaham"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"2 Chronicles 11:19","note":"She bore him sons: Jeush, Shemariah, and Zaham.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0029","lemma":"אֲבִיָּה","transliteration":"aviyyah","gloss":"Abijah"},{"id":"H7346","lemma":"רְחַבְעָם","transliteration":"rechavam","gloss":"Rehoboam"},{"id":"H4258","lemma":"מַחֲלַת","transliteration":"machalat","gloss":"Mahalath"},{"id":"H3266","lemma":"יְעוּשׁ","transliteration":"yeush","gloss":"Jeush"},{"id":"H8114","lemma":"שְׁמַרְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"shemaryah","gloss":"Shemariah"},{"id":"H6262","lemma":"עַתַּי","transliteration":"attay","gloss":"Attai"},{"id":"H2124","lemma":"זִיזָא","transliteration":"ziza","gloss":"Ziza"},{"id":"H8019","lemma":"שְׁלֹמִית","transliteration":"shelomit","gloss":"Shelomith"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}